#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:1
#: d68b564212154d94a03f1d5c2d27c766
msgid "多阶段训练架构"
msgstr "Multi-Stage Training Architecture"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:3
#: d4bce5e4de7944f6b9bbaa6b346c31e9
msgid ""
"部分先进的知识追踪模型采用了复合、分步或级联提升的训练范式。例如 ABKT 首先训练知识状态模块 KM 阶段，利用 IRT "
"拟合学生对知识点的掌握度；待 KM 阶段收敛并冻结后，计算作答残差与样本权重，进而进入能力模块 AM "
"阶段训练残差网络，最后由两阶段联合完成最终推断。"
msgstr ""
"Certain advanced knowledge tracing models employ composite, staged, or "
"boosting training paradigms. For instance, ABKT first trains a knowledge "
"module (KM) fitting student mastery via IRT; after KM converges and "
"freezes, response residuals and sample weights are computed to train an "
"ability module (AM) residual network, culminating in joint inference "
"across both stages."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:5
#: 40d81fcb5cf24d3ca9fee9dd8bacfe77
msgid "针对复杂的阶段化训练流程，UniKT 提供了 `MultiTrainer` 训练架构。其执行时序包含四个关键环节："
msgstr ""
"To support complex staged training workflows, UniKT provides the "
"`MultiTrainer` framework. Its execution timeline encompasses four key "
"phases:"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:7
#: 6b0931d0ac3d45c88cbc065d19b688fe
msgid "**获取阶段编排**：`MultiTrainer.run()` 触发 `build_stages()` 获取阶段配置列表。"
msgstr ""
"**Stage Orchestration**: `MultiTrainer.run()` triggers `build_stages()` "
"to obtain the sequence of stage configurations."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:8
#: ca73dd7dd91e4a70ba94b29ec5f43c0b
msgid "**延迟构建与独立训练**：按顺序逐个阶段调用构建函数，每个阶段独立拥有专用的模型、优化器、早停监控与学习率调度器。"
msgstr ""
"**Lazy Construction & Independent Training**: Calls builder functions "
"sequentially per stage, each equipped with dedicated models, optimizers, "
"early stopping monitors, and learning rate schedulers."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:9
#: e635e3d3f1db4dc4a283870a247362cb
msgid ""
"**阶段流转与残差通信**：阶段收敛完成后，触发 `on_stage_complete(stage_name, result)` "
"钩子，计算中间残差或更新下一阶段的输入特征。"
msgstr ""
"**Stage Transition & Residual Communication**: Upon stage convergence, "
"the `on_stage_complete(stage_name, result)` hook fires to compute "
"intermediate residuals or update input features for subsequent stages."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:10
#: e5f4e7b462534f1f86eacdea2fd25dfd
msgid ""
"**测试集联合推断**：所有阶段训练完成后触发测试评估，调用 `test_forward_pass(batch_data)` "
"联合各阶段模型完成最终推断。"
msgstr ""
"**Joint Test Inference**: Once all stages finish training, test "
"evaluation invokes `test_forward_pass(batch_data)` to execute joint "
"inference across trained models."

