#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:234
#: 87de37c3ff12458e9958d177c5c061cd
msgid "第五步：实现阶段化前向传播与损失计算"
msgstr "Step 5: Implement Staged Forward Pass and Loss Computation"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:236
#: 8cfa6c1c6dcd4b6f8b3b0cd097e4a01c
msgid "通过检查 `self._current_stage` 动态分支前向逻辑："
msgstr "Dynamically branch forward logic by checking `self._current_stage`:"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:238
#: 0fc52411a8344e11be1a2739fbb42803
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"    def forward_pass(self, batch_data: tuple) -> dict[str, torch.Tensor]:"
"\n"
"        \"\"\"按当前运行阶段分发前向计算。\"\"\"\n"
"        if self._current_stage == \"km\":\n"
"            return self._forward_km(batch_data)\n"
"        elif self._current_stage == \"am\":\n"
"            return self._forward_am(batch_data)\n"
"        else:\n"
"            raise ValueError(f\"未知的阶段: {self._current_stage}\")\n"
"\n"
"    def _forward_km(self, batch_data: tuple) -> dict:\n"
"        user_ids, items, corrects = batch_data\n"
"        # KM 阶段前向计算\n"
"        pred = self.km_model(user_ids, items)\n"
"        return {\n"
"            \"y_hat\": pred,\n"
"            \"y_label\": corrects.float(),\n"
"            \"y_predict\": (pred >= 0.5).int(),\n"
"            \"y_score\": pred,\n"
"            \"y_prob\": pred,\n"
"        }\n"
"\n"
"    def _forward_am(self, batch_data: tuple) -> dict:\n"
"        # AM 阶段前向计算\n"
"        batch = batch_data[0] if isinstance(batch_data, tuple) else "
"batch_data\n"
"        u_idx, i_idx, correct, km_pred = (\n"
"            batch[:, 0],\n"
"            batch[:, 1],\n"
"            batch[:, 2],\n"
"            batch[:, 3],\n"
"        )\n"
"\n"
"        am_pred, u_norm, i_norm = self.am_model(u_idx.long(), "
"i_idx.long())\n"
"        if self.run_config.model.combine_mode == \"mul\":\n"
"            final_pred = am_pred * km_pred\n"
"        else:\n"
"            final_pred = am_pred + km_pred\n"
"\n"
"        return {\n"
"            \"y_hat\": final_pred,\n"
"            \"y_label\": correct,\n"
"            \"y_predict\": (final_pred >= 0.5).int(),\n"
"            \"y_score\": final_pred,\n"
"            \"y_prob\": final_pred.clamp(0.0, 1.0),\n"
"            \"am_pred\": am_pred,\n"
"            \"km_pred\": km_pred,\n"
"            \"u_norm\": u_norm,\n"
"            \"i_norm\": i_norm,\n"
"        }\n"
msgstr ""
"    def forward_pass(self, batch_data: tuple) -> dict[str, torch.Tensor]:"
"\n"
"        \"\"\"Dispatch forward computation based on current stage.\"\"\"\n"
"        if self._current_stage == \"km\":\n"
"            return self._forward_km(batch_data)\n"
"        elif self._current_stage == \"am\":\n"
"            return self._forward_am(batch_data)\n"
"        else:\n"
"            raise ValueError(f\"Unknown stage: {self._current_stage}\")\n"
"\n"
"    def _forward_km(self, batch_data: tuple) -> dict:\n"
"        user_ids, items, corrects = batch_data\n"
"        # KM stage forward computation\n"
"        pred = self.km_model(user_ids, items)\n"
"        return {\n"
"            \"y_hat\": pred,\n"
"            \"y_label\": corrects.float(),\n"
"            \"y_predict\": (pred >= 0.5).int(),\n"
"            \"y_score\": pred,\n"
"            \"y_prob\": pred,\n"
"        }\n"
"\n"
"    def _forward_am(self, batch_data: tuple) -> dict:\n"
"        # AM stage forward computation\n"
"        batch = batch_data[0] if isinstance(batch_data, tuple) else "
"batch_data\n"
"        u_idx, i_idx, correct, km_pred = (\n"
"            batch[:, 0],\n"
"            batch[:, 1],\n"
"            batch[:, 2],\n"
"            batch[:, 3],\n"
"        )\n"
"\n"
"        am_pred, u_norm, i_norm = self.am_model(u_idx.long(), "
"i_idx.long())\n"
"        if self.run_config.model.combine_mode == \"mul\":\n"
"            final_pred = am_pred * km_pred\n"
"        else:\n"
"            final_pred = am_pred + km_pred\n"
"\n"
"        return {\n"
"            \"y_hat\": final_pred,\n"
"            \"y_label\": correct,\n"
"            \"y_predict\": (final_pred >= 0.5).int(),\n"
"            \"y_score\": final_pred,\n"
"            \"y_prob\": final_pred.clamp(0.0, 1.0),\n"
"            \"am_pred\": am_pred,\n"
"            \"km_pred\": km_pred,\n"
"            \"u_norm\": u_norm,\n"
"            \"i_norm\": i_norm,\n"
"        }\n"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:289
#: d5b9fcd7ca8c4979956932ef250b65d2
msgid "第六步：覆盖测试推断 (`test_forward_pass`)"
msgstr "Step 6: Override Test Inference (`test_forward_pass`)"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:291
#: de58f872b8ae42c382521acb53f80f05
msgid ""
"所有训练阶段完成后，UniKT 的 `TestEvaluationCallback` 会调用 "
"`test_forward_pass`。覆盖该方法以实现双模型联合推断："
msgstr ""
"After all training stages finish, UniKT's `TestEvaluationCallback` calls "
"`test_forward_pass`. Override this method for joint multi-stage "
"inference:"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:293
#: 70659f35e0b64011b38be81a7c6f2a5c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"    def test_forward_pass(self, batch_data: tuple) -> dict[str, "
"torch.Tensor]:\n"
"        \"\"\"多阶段联合测试推断。\"\"\"\n"
"        self.km_model.eval()\n"
"        self.am_model.eval()\n"
"\n"
"        user_ids, items, corrects = batch_data\n"
"        user_ids = self._move_tensor_to_device(user_ids)\n"
"        items = self._move_tensor_to_device(items)\n"
"        corrects = self._move_tensor_to_device(corrects)\n"
"\n"
"        # 1. 取得 KM 知识模块的预测\n"
"        km_pred = self.km_model(user_ids, items)\n"
"\n"
"        # 2. 取得 AM 能力模块的残差预测\n"
"        am_pred, _, _ = self.am_model(user_ids, items)\n"
"\n"
"        # 3. 联合推断\n"
"        if self.run_config.model.combine_mode == \"mul\":\n"
"            final_pred = am_pred * km_pred\n"
"        else:\n"
"            final_pred = am_pred + km_pred\n"
"\n"
"        final_pred = final_pred.clamp(0.0, 1.0)\n"
"        return {\n"
"            \"y_hat\": final_pred,\n"
"            \"y_label\": corrects.float(),\n"
"            \"y_predict\": (final_pred >= 0.5).int(),\n"
"            \"y_score\": final_pred,\n"
"            \"y_prob\": final_pred,\n"
"        }\n"
msgstr ""
"    def test_forward_pass(self, batch_data: tuple) -> dict[str, "
"torch.Tensor]:\n"
"        \"\"\"Multi-stage joint test inference.\"\"\"\n"
"        self.km_model.eval()\n"
"        self.am_model.eval()\n"
"\n"
"        user_ids, items, corrects = batch_data\n"
"        user_ids = self._move_tensor_to_device(user_ids)\n"
"        items = self._move_tensor_to_device(items)\n"
"        corrects = self._move_tensor_to_device(corrects)\n"
"\n"
"        # 1. Obtain KM prediction\n"
"        km_pred = self.km_model(user_ids, items)\n"
"\n"
"        # 2. Obtain AM residual prediction\n"
"        am_pred, _, _ = self.am_model(user_ids, items)\n"
"\n"
"        # 3. Joint inference\n"
"        if self.run_config.model.combine_mode == \"mul\":\n"
"            final_pred = am_pred * km_pred\n"
"        else:\n"
"            final_pred = am_pred + km_pred\n"
"\n"
"        final_pred = final_pred.clamp(0.0, 1.0)\n"
"        return {\n"
"            \"y_hat\": final_pred,\n"
"            \"y_label\": corrects.float(),\n"
"            \"y_predict\": (final_pred >= 0.5).int(),\n"
"            \"y_score\": final_pred,\n"
"            \"y_prob\": final_pred,\n"
"        }\n"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:328
#: c8d9aa6dc8cc4f54b0dfdb582a75676b
msgid "最佳实践与注意事项"
msgstr "Best Practices and Considerations"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:331
#: b855254048b24a9e90e3b592534c6ecd
msgid ""
"**早停指标与检查点解耦**：在 `StageComponents` 中，可设置 `checkpoint_monitor` 与 "
"`early_stopping.monitor` 不同。例如在 ABKT 中，KM 阶段早停监控 `acc`，但检查点可指定保存验证集上 "
"`auc` 最高时的模型权重："
msgstr ""
"**Decouple Early Stopping from Checkpointing**: In `StageComponents`, "
"`checkpoint_monitor` can differ from `early_stopping.monitor`. For "
"instance in ABKT, the KM stage monitors `acc` for early stopping while "
"checkpointing the model with the highest validation `auc`:"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:332
#: c4267bd2b93e42b38bde979c5722dae5
msgid ""
"StageComponents(\n"
"    ...\n"
"    early_stopping=EarlyStoppingConfig(monitor=\"acc\", mode=\"max\", "
"patience=10),\n"
"    checkpoint_monitor=\"auc\",\n"
"    checkpoint_mode=\"max\",\n"
")\n"
msgstr ""
"StageComponents(\n"
"    ...\n"
"    early_stopping=EarlyStoppingConfig(monitor=\"acc\", mode=\"max\", "
"patience=10),\n"
"    checkpoint_monitor=\"auc\",\n"
"    checkpoint_mode=\"max\",\n"
")\n"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/multi-stage-training.md:340
#: 4de1cc5aeeca4bc8ade699736441fffe
msgid ""
"**显存主动释放**：当切换阶段时，若前序阶段的优化器或中间激活值体积较大，可在 `on_stage_complete` 中将其从 GPU 上移至"
" CPU，或调用 `torch.cuda.empty_cache()`，防止两阶段显存叠加导致 OOM。"
msgstr ""
"**Proactive Memory Management**: When transitioning stages, if prior "
"optimizers or activations occupy significant memory, transfer them from "
"GPU to CPU in `on_stage_complete` or invoke `torch.cuda.empty_cache()` to"
" prevent compounded OOM errors."
